/-- the interior means is the mathematical object specified below. [The Interior Means](goal) is determined by [the displayed parameters](hyp:θ). -/
def InteriorMeans : Prop :=
  0 < θ 0 ∧ θ 0 < 1 ∧ 0 < θ 1 ∧ θ 1 < 1

